    {
        "id": "p1tab001",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Fluvius P1 — Belgium example",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Example: Fluvius P1 smart meter → effekttariff-p1 → effekttariff (Belgium / Capaciteitstarief)\n\nIn production, replace the inject nodes with your actual MQTT or ESPHome P1 source.\n\nWiring:\n  P1 source → effekttariff-p1 → effekttariff (Belgium preset)\n\nThe effekttariff-p1 node normalises the meter's quarter-hour demand (OBIS 1-0:1.4.0)\nto Watts and passes it to the effekttariff node, which tracks the exact billing value\nFluvius uses for the capaciteitstarief.",
        "env": []
    },
